{"resourceIdentifier":"5136","resourceName":"Fujian Nan'an Shengda Aluminium Recycling Project","description":"Fujian Nan'an Shengda Aluminium Recycling Project (hereafter referred to as “the project”) aims to produce aluminum products by reprocessing waste aluminum products (i. e., clean scraps produced by aluminum products enterprises). And replace the same aluminum products produced from the raw materials. The total production capacity is about 13,747 tons of aluminum product per year, among them, 14500 tons of aluminium scrap is utilised annually. The Project is located in Nan'an City, Fujian Province, China and is developed and operated by Fujian Nan'an City Shengda Aluminium Alloy Co., Ltd. \r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of aluminum was produced from raw materials; the baseline scenario is the same as the condition prior to project initiation. The Project achieves GHG emission reductions by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and by reducing related energy consumption as well.\r\nThe first crediting period of the project is from 30-Jan-2023 to 29-Jan-2030. The estimated annual average GHG emission reductions are 59,410 tCO2e and the total estimated GHG emission reductions over the first crediting period are 415,870 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":25.019175,"longitude":118.354526},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-07-16","endExclusive":"2024-08-16","endInclusive":"2024-08-15"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5136"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Nan'an City Shengda Aluminium Alloy Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Fujian Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59030"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VMR0007"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"18/01/2026"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/01/2023 - 29/01/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=115911&IDKEY=n98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8df159841269","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_PCP_5136_16JUL2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-07-16T19:58:07.277Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=114204&IDKEY=80e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla99157487316","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"01-shendaVCS Listing-Representation-Single-5136 12062024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-06-14T03:42:28.553Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=144314&IDKEY=r903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdff199009006","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCSPDMR-version04.pdf","uploadDate":"2026-01-18T08:22:34.24Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=126450&IDKEY=998klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8174374550","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"05-5136-Registration-Representation-5136-23012025.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-01-24T12:32:42.927Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=144315&IDKEY=k98